          "filename": "Hall of Fame - Bronx, NY (48344563331).jpg",
          "caption": "Hall of Famous Americans located on Bronx Community College (formerly the campus of New York University) is the original, \"Hall of Fame\". It includes like about 100 busts of famous men (pretty sure they are ALL men - it's an artifact from an earlier, less equal, era). All other \"Hall of Fames\" (like Baseball Hall of Fame, Rock-n-Roll Hall of Fame, etc...) followed. This Hall of Fame, turns out to be pretty boring compared to those others, but it is very beautiful place to visit. It is located on one of the highest natural points in New York City.",
